title = "Docker Swarm instead of a k3s platform"
date = 2026-08-04
description = "Swarm mode is still in the Docker Engine, still shipping bug fixes, and still dismissed because people confuse it with a different product that was removed in 2023. It is the strongest just-enough-orchestration option for a small fleet. Here is what it genuinely gives you, what it costs you, and the fleet size where the answer flips."
series = "self-hosting"
